#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:4
msgid "v3.3.0"
msgstr "v3.3.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.3.0 is a huge release. It adds full **FLIR Lepton thermal-camera** "
"support with a new :func:`sensor.ioctl` interface and color palettes, a "
"``tv`` SPI video-output module, **global-shutter triggered mode**, a big "
"batch of new :mod:`image` drawing/analysis methods (``gamma_corr()``, "
"``draw_ellipse()``, ``draw_edges()``, many blob properties), and new ToF / "
"motor / linalg libraries. The ``cpufreq`` API was reworked and "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` now raises — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.3.0 är en enorm utgåva. Den lägger till fullt stöd för **FLIR Lepton-"
"värmekamera** med ett nytt :func:`sensor.ioctl`\\ -gränssnitt och "
"färgpaletter, en ``tv``\\ -modul för SPI-videoutmatning, **global-shutter-"
"utlöst läge**\\ , en stor uppsättning nya :mod:`image`\\ -metoder för "
"ritning/analys (\\ ``gamma_corr()``\\ , ``draw_ellipse()``\\ , "
"``draw_edges()``\\ , många blob-egenskaper) samt nya bibliotek för ToF, "
"motorer och linalg. ``cpufreq``\\ -API:et omarbetades och "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` ger nu ett undantag — läs de brytande "
"ändringarna nedan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "På den här sidan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Höjdpunkter"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — full thermal-camera support via the new "
":func:`sensor.ioctl` interface, color palettes, and ``image.to_rainbow()``."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — fullt stöd för värmekamera via det nya "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`\\ -gränssnittet, färgpaletter och "
"``image.to_rainbow()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:24
msgid "``tv`` module — SPI TV / composite video output."
msgstr "``tv``\\ -modul — SPI-TV / composite-videoutmatning."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Global-shutter triggered mode** — MT9V034 triggered capture via "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`."
msgstr ""
"**Global-shutter-utlöst läge** — MT9V034-utlöst infångning via "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Imaging** — ``gamma_corr()``, ``draw_ellipse()``, ``draw_edges()``, "
"``draw_image()`` alpha blending, and many new blob properties."
msgstr ""
"**Bildbehandling** — ``gamma_corr()``\\ , ``draw_ellipse()``\\ , "
"``draw_edges()``\\ , alfablandning i ``draw_image()`` och många nya blob-"
"egenskaper."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**New libraries** — VL53L1X ToF distance, TB6612 motor driver, micro-linalg."
msgstr ""
"**Nya bibliotek** — VL53L1X ToF-avstånd, TB6612-motordrivrutin, micro-"
"linalg."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the ``cpufreq`` API was reworked, :func:`sensor.set_framesize`"
" now raises on failure, :func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` dropped Bayer/JPEG, "
"and ``image.replace()`` positional args shifted — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Brytande:** ``cpufreq``\\ -API:et omarbetades, "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` ger nu ett undantag vid fel, "
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` släppte Bayer/JPEG och de positionsbaserade "
"argumenten i ``image.replace()`` förskjöts — se de brytande ändringarna."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:37
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nya funktioner"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — added :func:`sensor.ioctl` for sensor-specific control and"
" a full set of Lepton ioctls (radiometry, refresh/resolution, run-command, "
"set/get attribute, FPA/AUX temperature in °C, measurement mode/range, "
"width/height), :func:`sensor.set_color_palette` / "
":func:`sensor.get_color_palette` with ``sensor.PALETTE_RAINBOW`` / "
"``PALETTE_IRONBOW``, ``image.to_rainbow()``, and Lepton example scripts "
"(27-Lepton)."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — lade till :func:`sensor.ioctl` för sensorspecifik styrning"
" och en komplett uppsättning Lepton-ioctls (radiometri, "
"uppdatering/upplösning, kör-kommando, sätt/hämta attribut, FPA/AUX-"
"temperatur i °C, mätläge/-intervall, bredd/höjd), "
":func:`sensor.set_color_palette` / :func:`sensor.get_color_palette` med "
"``sensor.PALETTE_RAINBOW`` / ``PALETTE_IRONBOW``\\ , ``image.to_rainbow()`` "
"samt Lepton-exempelskript (27-Lepton)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Triggered mode** — ``IOCTL_SET_TRIGGERED_MODE`` / "
"``IOCTL_GET_TRIGGERED_MODE`` for MT9V034 global-shutter triggered capture, "
"with high-FPS and triggered-mode examples."
msgstr ""
"**Utlöst läge** — ``IOCTL_SET_TRIGGERED_MODE`` / "
"``IOCTL_GET_TRIGGERED_MODE`` för MT9V034 global-shutter-utlöst infångning, "
"med exempel för hög FPS och utlöst läge."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:48
msgid "``tv`` module — added SPI TV / composite video output bindings."
msgstr ""
"``tv``\\ -modul — lade till bindningar för SPI-TV / composite-"
"videoutmatning."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Imaging** — added ``image.gamma_corr()``, ``image.draw_ellipse()``, "
"``image.draw_edges()``, ``draw_image()`` alpha blending, a ``mask=`` keyword"
" on ``clear()``, re-added ``mask_rectangle()`` / ``mask_circle()`` / "
"``mask_ellipse()``, rotation / hmirror / vflip keywords on ``draw_string()``"
" / ``draw_text()``, a ``transpose`` keyword (and ``assign`` / ``set`` "
"aliases) on ``replace()``, ``copy()`` ``x_scale`` / ``y_scale`` plus "
"``crop()`` / ``scale()``, an ``Image()`` constructor from dimensions, the "
"``sensor.BINARY`` pixformat, exported color-space conversion functions, and "
"many new blob properties (``corners``, ``perimeter``, ``roundness``, "
"``elongation``, ``extent``, ``compactness``, ``solidity``, ``convexity``, "
"``enclosing_circle``, ``enclosed_ellipse``, rotation)."
msgstr ""
"**Bildbehandling** — lade till ``image.gamma_corr()``\\ , "
"``image.draw_ellipse()``\\ , ``image.draw_edges()``\\ , alfablandning i "
"``draw_image()``\\ , ett ``mask=``\\ -nyckelord på ``clear()``\\ , "
"återinförde ``mask_rectangle()`` / ``mask_circle()`` / ``mask_ellipse()``\\ "
", nyckelord för rotation / hmirror / vflip på ``draw_string()`` / "
"``draw_text()``\\ , ett ``transpose``\\ -nyckelord (och aliasen ``assign`` /"
" ``set``\\ ) på ``replace()``\\ , ``copy()`` med ``x_scale`` / ``y_scale`` "
"plus ``crop()`` / ``scale()``\\ , en ``Image()``\\ -konstruktor från "
"dimensioner, pixelformatet ``sensor.BINARY``\\ , exporterade funktioner för "
"färgrymdskonvertering samt många nya blob-egenskaper (\\ ``corners``\\ , "
"``perimeter``\\ , ``roundness``\\ , ``elongation``\\ , ``extent``\\ , "
"``compactness``\\ , ``solidity``\\ , ``convexity``\\ , "
"``enclosing_circle``\\ , ``enclosed_ellipse``\\ , rotation)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Libraries** — added the :mod:`vl53l1x` ToF distance-sensor driver, the "
":mod:`tb6612` motor driver (with DC-motor and stepper Motor-Shield "
"examples), and a micro-linalg library (``ulinalg`` / ``umatrix``)."
msgstr ""
"**Bibliotek** — lade till drivrutinen :mod:`vl53l1x` för ToF-avståndssensor,"
" motordrivrutinen :mod:`tb6612` (med exempel för DC-motor och stegmotor på "
"Motor-Shield) samt ett micro-linalg-bibliotek (\\ ``ulinalg`` / "
"``umatrix``\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:63
msgid "Upgraded FatFS to FF13C (exFAT-capable)."
msgstr "Uppgraderade FatFS till FF13C (exFAT-kapabel)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:66
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Övriga ändringar och förbättringar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:68
msgid ""
"Improved the default JPEG quality (mid-range of low–high instead of a "
"hardcoded value); in-place image ops no longer require repeating the image "
"as the first argument; ``draw_string()`` accepts non-integer scale values."
msgstr ""
"Förbättrade standardkvaliteten för JPEG (mittintervall mellan låg–hög i "
"stället för ett hårdkodat värde); operationer på bilder på plats kräver inte"
" längre att bilden upprepas som första argument; ``draw_string()`` "
"accepterar nu skalvärden som inte är heltal."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:73
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Buggfixar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:75
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "Kamera och sensorer:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"Fixed Lepton 3.5 startup hang (timeout + recovery) and reset reliability, "
"MT9V034 ``set_framesize()`` before ``set_pixformat()`` (call order no longer"
" matters), MT9V034 WVGA on the STM32H7, the MT9V034 auto-exposure range and "
"shadow-register updates, and the H7 ADC bug."
msgstr ""
"Fixade Lepton 3.5-startupphängning (timeout + återställning) och "
"tillförlitlighet vid återställning, MT9V034 ``set_framesize()`` före "
"``set_pixformat()`` (anropsordningen spelar inte längre någon roll), MT9V034"
" WVGA på STM32H7, MT9V034:s autoexponeringsintervall och uppdateringar av "
"skuggregister samt H7 ADC-buggen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:82
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "Bildbehandling:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:84
msgid ""
"Fixed an invalid memory access in ``find_apriltags()``, ``copy()`` when "
"copying a scaled image to the main framebuffer, ``to_grayscale()`` / "
"``to_rgb565()`` framebuffer allocation, the keypoint object ``len()``, JPEG "
"MCU boundary handling, ``binary()`` threshold-list parsing, and "
"``draw_keypoints()`` accepting keypoint tuples."
msgstr ""
"Fixade en ogiltig minnesåtkomst i ``find_apriltags()``\\ , ``copy()`` vid "
"kopiering av en skalad bild till huvudbildbufferten, bildbuffertallokering i"
" ``to_grayscale()`` / ``to_rgb565()``\\ , ``len()`` på nyckelpunktsobjektet,"
" hantering av JPEG MCU-gränser, parsning av tröskelvärdeslistor i "
"``binary()`` samt att ``draw_keypoints()`` accepterar nyckelpunktstupler."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:90
msgid "System:"
msgstr "System:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:92
msgid ""
"Fixed ``fb_alloc`` mark/free imbalance leaks across :mod:`image` / "
":mod:`fir` / ``lcd`` / ``tv`` / ``nn`` methods, made ``py_assert`` free "
"framebuffer memory on caught exceptions (#417), cleared the UART overrun "
"(ORE) flag so overruns no longer wedge UART reads, fixed the RTC IRQ "
"handler, and fixed the Windows ``cascade_convert.py`` tool."
msgstr ""
"Fixade läckor från obalans i ``fb_alloc`` mark/free över metoder i "
":mod:`image` / :mod:`fir` / ``lcd`` / ``tv`` / ``nn``\\ , fick ``py_assert``"
" att frigöra bildbuffertminne vid fångade undantag (#417), rensade UART-"
"överskridningsflaggan (ORE) så att överskridningar inte längre låser UART-"
"läsningar, fixade RTC IRQ-hanteraren samt fixade Windows-verktyget "
"``cascade_convert.py``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:99
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hårdvaru- och kortstöd"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:101
msgid "**FLIR Lepton** thermal camera."
msgstr "**FLIR Lepton**\\ -värmekamera."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:102
msgid "**TV shield** — SPI TV / composite video output."
msgstr "**TV-shield** — SPI-TV / composite-videoutmatning."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:103
msgid "**Global-shutter (MT9V034)** triggered mode."
msgstr "**Global-shutter (MT9V034)**\\ -utlöst läge."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:106
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Brytande API-ändringar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:108
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.2.0 and v3.3.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Användarsynliga API-brytningar mellan v3.2.0 och v3.3.0. Omfattning: Python "
"C-moduler i ``modules/`` och Python-bibliotek i ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:111
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Varje ändring är märkt med sin påverkan:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:113
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*major* — påverkar de flesta skript som använde funktionen; du behöver porta"
" kod."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:115
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor* — smalt API; påverkar endast skript som använde det."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:116
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — samma API, andra resultat; kontrollera om finjusterade skript."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:118
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_3_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Ändringarna grupperas efter påverkan i den ordningen. Om du bara vill porta "
"din kod, hoppa till :ref:`migreringschecklistan <v3_3_0_migration>` i "
"slutet. Varje commit-hash länkar till sin diff på GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:125
msgid "``cpufreq`` API reworked *(major)*"
msgstr "``cpufreq``\\ -API:et omarbetat *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:127
msgid ""
"The ``cpufreq`` module was reworked for H7 support. The "
"``cpufreq.CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168`` / ``192`` / ``216MHZ`` "
"constants and ``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` were removed. "
"``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` now takes a plain MHz integer (e.g. "
"``cpufreq.set_frequency(120)``), and ``cpufreq.get_current_frequencies()`` /"
" ``cpufreq.get_supported_frequencies()`` were added."
msgstr ""
"``cpufreq``\\ -modulen omarbetades för H7-stöd. Konstanterna "
"``cpufreq.CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168`` / ``192`` / ``216MHZ`` och "
"``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` togs bort. ``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` tar nu "
"ett vanligt MHz-heltal (t.ex. ``cpufreq.set_frequency(120)``\\ ), och "
"``cpufreq.get_current_frequencies()`` / "
"``cpufreq.get_supported_frequencies()`` lades till."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `6babf84a1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6babf84a1>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `6babf84a1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6babf84a1>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:139
msgid "``image.replace()`` positional arguments shifted *(minor)*"
msgstr "``image.replace()`` positionsbaserade argument förskjutna *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:141
msgid ""
"``image.replace()`` gained a ``transpose`` argument, shifting the positional"
" ``mask`` argument from position 4 to position 5. Code that passed ``mask`` "
"positionally (e.g. ``img.replace(src, hmirror, vflip, mask)``) must switch "
"to the keyword form ``img.replace(src, mask=mask)``."
msgstr ""
"``image.replace()`` fick ett ``transpose``\\ -argument, vilket förskjuter "
"det positionsbaserade ``mask``\\ -argumentet från position 4 till position "
"5. Kod som skickade ``mask`` positionellt (t.ex. ``img.replace(src, hmirror,"
" vflip, mask)``\\ ) måste byta till nyckelordsformen ``img.replace(src, "
"mask=mask)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:146
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `dbe7bf059 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/dbe7bf059>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `dbe7bf059 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/dbe7bf059>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:151
msgid ":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` no longer accepts Bayer/JPEG *(minor)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` accepterar inte längre Bayer/JPEG *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:153
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` no longer accepts ``sensor.BAYER`` or "
"``sensor.JPEG`` (it now also supports ``sensor.BINARY``). Code that "
"allocated extra framebuffers in Bayer or JPEG format must use ``GRAYSCALE`` "
"/ ``RGB565`` (or allocate the buffer another way)."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` accepterar inte längre ``sensor.BAYER`` eller "
"``sensor.JPEG`` (den stöder nu även ``sensor.BINARY``\\ ). Kod som "
"allokerade extra bildbuffertar i Bayer- eller JPEG-format måste använda "
"``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` (eller allokera bufferten på annat sätt)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f9e6b3fe0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f9e6b3fe0>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `f9e6b3fe0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f9e6b3fe0>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:163
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_framesize` raises on failure *(behavior)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.set_framesize` ger ett undantag vid fel *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:165
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` now raises a ``ValueError`` when the framesize "
"is unsupported instead of returning ``False``. Code that checked the "
"``False`` return value must catch the ``ValueError`` exception instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` ger nu ett ``ValueError`` när bildrutestorleken"
" inte stöds i stället för att returnera ``False``\\ . Kod som kontrollerade "
"returvärdet ``False`` måste i stället fånga undantaget ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:169
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b0442633e <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b0442633e>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `b0442633e <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b0442633e>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:174
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migreringschecklista"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:176
msgid "For a clean port to v3.3.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "För en ren portning till v3.3.0 är det typiska arbetet:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:178
msgid ""
"Port ``cpufreq`` code to integer-MHz ``set_frequency()`` and "
"``get_current_frequencies()`` / ``get_supported_frequencies()`` (:ref:`the "
"cpufreq rework <v3_3_0_cpufreq>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porta ``cpufreq``\\ -kod till ``set_frequency()`` med heltals-MHz och "
"``get_current_frequencies()`` / ``get_supported_frequencies()`` (\\ "
":ref:`cpufreq-omarbetningen <v3_3_0_cpufreq>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:181
msgid ""
"Pass ``mask`` to ``image.replace()`` as a keyword (:ref:`the replace change "
"<v3_3_0_replace>`)."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ``mask`` till ``image.replace()`` som ett nyckelord (\\ "
":ref:`replace-ändringen <v3_3_0_replace>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:183
msgid ""
"Allocate extra framebuffers as ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` instead of "
"Bayer/JPEG (:ref:`the alloc_extra_fb change <v3_3_0_extrafb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Allokera extra bildbuffertar som ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` i stället för "
"Bayer/JPEG (\\ :ref:`alloc_extra_fb-ändringen <v3_3_0_extrafb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:185
msgid ""
"Catch ``ValueError`` around :func:`sensor.set_framesize` instead of checking"
" for ``False`` (:ref:`the set_framesize change <v3_3_0_setframesize>`)."
msgstr ""
"Fånga ``ValueError`` runt :func:`sensor.set_framesize` i stället för att "
"kontrollera mot ``False`` (\\ :ref:`set_framesize-ändringen "
"<v3_3_0_setframesize>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:188
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Alla andra skript körs oförändrade."
